---
import Image from "astro:assets";

---

<header class="header-wrapper">
    <div class="header-container">
        <div class="header-text">
            <h1>Esti gata sa iti spun povestea?</h1>
            <p>Fiecare poveste de dragoste merita sa fie imortalizata cu emotie</p>
            <p>Hai sa transformam momentele tale in amintiri de neuitat, cu fotografii care reflecta cine esti cu adevarat.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="btn">Rezerva Data</button>
    </div>
</header>


<style lang="scss">
    @use "../styles/variables" as *;

    .header-wrapper {
        @include flex-center;
        background: linear-gradient(#66666635,#00000045,#00000050), url("../assets/first-page/header-f-page.png");
        background-position: center;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-size: cover;
        height: 100svh;
    }

    .header-container {
        @include flex-center;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap:2rem;
        padding: 0 2rem;

        >button {
            @include btn-default;
        }
    }

    .header-text {
        @include flex-center;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;

        >h1, p {
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        >h1 {
            @include header-playfair;
            font-size: 5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        >p {
            @include para-playfair;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-style: italic;
            max-width: 65ch;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
    }

</style>